stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> PendingPayment : <font color='#0277bd'><b>CreateOrder</b></font>
    PendingPayment --> Paid : <font color='#0277bd'><b>PaySuccess</b></font> <font color='#e65100'>/ SendPaymentNotification</font>
    PendingPayment --> Cancelled : <font color='#0277bd'><b>PayTimeout</b></font>
    Paid --> Shipped : <font color='#0277bd'><b>Ship</b></font>
    Shipped --> Completed : <font color='#0277bd'><b>ConfirmReceipt</b></font>
    Shipped --> Completed : <font color='#0277bd'><b>AutoConfirmTimeout</b></font> <font color='#e65100'>/ AutoConfirmReceipt</font>
    Paid --> Cancelled : <font color='#0277bd'><b>ApplyRefund</b></font> <font color='#8e24aa'>[AmountLte100]</font> <font color='#e65100'>/ AutoRefund</font>
    Paid --> PendingAudit : <font color='#0277bd'><b>ApplyRefund</b></font> <font color='#8e24aa'>[AmountGt100]</font> <font color='#e65100'>/ TransferToManualAudit</font>
    PendingAudit --> Cancelled : <font color='#0277bd'><b>AuditPass</b></font> <font color='#e65100'>/ RefundToAccount</font>
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    classDef initialStyle fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1,stroke-width:2px;
